### Health
GET http://127.0.0.1:8000/health

### Readiness
GET http://127.0.0.1:8000/readiness

### Reindex knowledge base
POST http://127.0.0.1:8000/knowledge/reindex
X-API-Key: dev-api-key

### Search knowledge
GET http://127.0.0.1:8000/knowledge/search?query=production%20api%20500

### Create ticket
POST http://127.0.0.1:8000/tickets
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "customer_email": "alex@example.com",
  "subject": "Production API returns 500",
  "description": "Our production API endpoint returns 500 errors and customers are blocked."
}

### Run workflow
POST http://127.0.0.1:8000/tickets/{{ticket_id}}/workflow-runs

### List workflow runs
GET http://127.0.0.1:8000/tickets/{{ticket_id}}/workflow-runs

### Get analytics
GET http://127.0.0.1:8000/analytics/summary

### Seed demo tickets
POST http://127.0.0.1:8000/demo/seed
X-API-Key: dev-api-key
